      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          326.9801493467934,
          352.5853743697479,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "persuasive people with strong characters, special skills and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          343.5359444774348,
          346.46469453781526,
          12.10645516627062
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "attributes, and they are not afraid to challenge the system."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          360.09173960807607,
          307.59080294117655,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Their diversity contributes tremendously to Nissan’s"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          376.6475225653206,
          360.5686945378152,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "success. The cumulative work of all these divisions results in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          393.20331769596214,
          335.0505184873949,
          12.106442992874008
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "a very consistent organization with an upstream process"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          409.75913717339677,
          108.75107016806726,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "that creates value."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          566.9269487394959,
          426.3149688242281,
          334.98174873949586,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Looking at Nissan’s global output over the last six years,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          442.87078830166274,
          358.0061084033613,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "it is clear that some terrific products have been created, and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          459.4266199524941,
          345.7573928571428,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the value of the Company as a whole is greater. There are"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          475.98245160332544,
          328.0366415966387,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "many scorecards that reflect this, and our stakeholders"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          492.53827108076007,
          332.67841008403366,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "certainly know Nissan’s success first-hand. At the same"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          509.0941027315914,
          348.3506773109244,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "time, we must prepare for the future. We need to reinforce"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          525.6499343824228,
          320.07676722689087,
          12.106442992874065
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the strength of our program management groups and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          542.2057538598575,
          352.1870886554623,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "establish more precise, accurate groups to standardize and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          558.7615855106889,
          279.0328386554622,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "improve processes for the future. Ironically, our"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          575.3174049881235,
          319.2918756302521,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "achievements have created uncertainty for the future."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          591.8732366389548,
          309.5807155462186,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Success creates risk, and the more we highlight our"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          608.4290682897862,
          351.6188941176471,
          12.106442992874179
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "successes, the more we raise the anxiety level of investors."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          624.9848877672209,
          333.83078571428575,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "How can our new products be as good as those already"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.5114142857143,
          641.5407194180523,
          242.44032142857145,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "released? How can we keep it all going?"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          566.9269487394959,
          658.0965388954869,
          318.19373025210075,
          12.106455166270734
