          356.68096428571425,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "market knowledge and even financial strategy. Yet we must"
